    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Forest Ranger Services series are based on real life events and personal accounts of hikers. The narrative has been altered for entertainment purposes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are thousands of missing reports filed each year in the U.S National Parks. Many cases remain unexplained.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU ARE THE MAIN CHARACTER OF THE SERIES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the events that continue from the first episode and learn more details about the story.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the mystery of missing hikers in U.S. National Parks.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to strange individuals - meet new characters and follow their story through the episodes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the FBI man and his assignement.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More interactions than the first episode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve simple puzzles and find your way to safety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual driving with a twist!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Forest Ranger Services series are based on real life events and personal accounts of hikers. The narrative has been altered for entertainment purposes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are thousands of missing reports filed each year in the U.S National Parks. Many cases remain unexplained.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU ARE THE MAIN CHARACTER OF THE SERIES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the events that continue from the first episode and learn more details about the story.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the mystery of missing hikers in U.S. National Parks.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to strange individuals - meet new characters and follow their story through the episodes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the FBI man and his assignement.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More interactions than the first episode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve simple puzzles and find your way to safety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual driving with a twist!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Horror game series about the investigation of missing hikers in the U.S. National Parks. Follow the story of a wannabe reporter who got a job as a ranger to investigate the disappearances - several episodes that tell one story! Based on true events.",
